.SS "\fBGLFWAPI\fP \fBvoid\fP glfwSetCursor (\fBGLFWwindow\fP * window, \fBGLFWcursor\fP * cursor)"

.PP
Sets the cursor for the window\&. This function sets the cursor image to be used when the cursor is over the content area of the specified window\&. The set cursor will only be visible when the \fBcursor mode\fP of the window is \fRGLFW_CURSOR_NORMAL\fP\&.
