.SS "\fBGLFWAPI\fP \fBvoid\fP glfwSetTime (double time)"

.PP
Sets the GLFW time\&. This function sets the current GLFW time, in seconds\&. The value must be a positive finite number less than or equal to 18446744073\&.0, which is approximately 584\&.5 years\&.
.PP
This function and \fBglfwGetTime\fP are helper functions on top of \fBglfwGetTimerFrequency\fP and \fBglfwGetTimerValue\fP\&.
.PP
